                                                "sense_id": "5b707056-ee56-34aa-b6b7-e26e97af481f",
                                                "text": "Two vultures […] stood silent side by side like smoking coworkers on break, one charcoal eye staring back at me indifferently."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "40349d93-93be-3e22-b5f0-6ae3090ac454",
